{
 "id": "long01",
 "show": "FULL CLEAR",
 "title": "10 things to do first in GTA 6",
 "episode": "Starter guide · Nov 2026",
 "lines": [
  [
   "Dev",
   "Dev here, from Full Clear."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "GTA Six is finally out, and Leonida is huge."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "So here are ten things to do first."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "No story spoilers, and every tip has a source on screen. Let's go."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Number one: save the game yourself."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Open the pause menu, go to Game, then Save Game."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Autosave mostly happens after bigger missions, and every new autosave replaces the last one."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "You also can't save during a mission, a chase or a fight."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "And there's no quit button."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "So save before you close the game."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Number two: don't panic about missing bonuses."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Rockstar spreads the edition extras across the story, chapter by chapter."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "If you have GTA Plus on console, the Elegy sports car and the Crosstown garage show up in Chapter Three."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Number three: two settings."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "On console, the game targets thirty frames per second."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "There's no performance mode."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "If motion looks choppy, try the motion blur slider in the display settings."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "And if fights feel too hard, Accessible Combat is in the gameplay settings. No shame."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Number four: the cops remember your outfit."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Change clothes, and they lose track of you much faster."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Pro tip: store outfits in your car's trunk at the safehouse."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "At one star, you can sometimes talk your way out."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Put the gun away, focus on the officer, and choose defuse."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "And if a stolen car shows a red icon, it has a tracker. Ditch it."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Number five: bank your cash."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Get busted or wasted, and the money in your pocket is gone."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Once the bank app unlocks, deposit it."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Number six: get in the air early."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "There's a helicopter on a helipad over the water in the Keys, and you can just take it."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "And about two and a half miles from Jason's place, at the boatyard in Southwind, seaplanes sit in the hangar."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Nobody guards them."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Number seven: make your first real money."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "At Ambrosia Raceway Park, you can rent a car and win demolition derbies, again and again."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "The figure-eight pays roughly double the oval."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "And from Chapter Two, Bret's hunting cabin in Mount Kalaga buys the animals you hunt."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Number eight: use your phone camera."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Scanning landmarks and odd sculptures fills a collection."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Easy first ones: the Wonder Whale in Key Lento, and Belpoint Lighthouse. Got scuba gear?"
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Shipwrecks off Key Lento hide artefacts you can sell."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Number nine: travel smarter."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "The RydeMe app gets you a taxi, and skipping the ride costs a hundred dollars."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "From Chapter Two, you can switch between Jason and Lucia."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "If it's greyed out, the other one is busy."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Number ten: turn on Vice City FM."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "One of the hosts is Weird Al Yankovic. Rockstar confirmed it."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "And then, do something stupid. Like these players."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Someone took an airboat out of the swamp and onto the highway."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Someone else tried to steal a 747. It taxis. It turns."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "It does not fly."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "And one guy took a helicopter to a cruise ship."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "The passengers were not impressed. That's ten."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Every spot from this video is pinned on our free map at fullclearmap dot com."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Mark what you've found."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "It saves in your browser."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Found something we missed?"
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "Send it in our Discord. I'm Dev."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "This was Full Clear."
  ],
  [
   "Dev",
   "See you in Leonida."
  ]
 ],
